onth.\",\"line\":10,\"span\":\"Totals must be submitted by 12:00 on the 18th of the month.\"},{\"text\":\"The 18th is a hard cut-off, not a target.\",\"line\":10,\"span\":\"The 18th is a hard\\ncut-off, not a target.\"},{\"text\":\"Submissions that arrive after the cut-off are held for the following month's run.\",\"line\":11,\"span\":\"Submissions that arrive after it are held for the\\nfollowing month's run.\"},{\"text\":\"If the 18th falls on a weekend or a public holiday, the cut-off moves to the last working day before the 18th.\",\"line\":14,\"span\":\"If the 18th falls on a weekend or a public holiday, the cut-off moves to the\\nlast working day before it.\"},{\"text\":\"One file per team must be submitted.\",\"line\":19,\"span\":\"Submit one file per team.\"},{\"text\":\"The submitted file must list every hourly worker with hours and the cost centre the hours are charged to.\",\"line\":19,\"span\":\"The file must list every hourly worker with hours and\\nthe cost centre the hours are charged to.\"},{\"text\":\"Blank rows are rejected by the upload page.\",\"line\":20,\"span\":\"Blank rows are rejected by the upload\\npage.\"},{\"text\":\"A correction submitted before the cut-off replaces the earlier file entirely.\",\"line\":25,\"span\":\"A correction submitted before the cut-off replaces the earlier file entirely.\"},{\"text\":\"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request.\",\"line\":26,\"span\":\"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request and\\nare applied to the following month.\"},{\"text\":\"Corrections made after the cut-off are applied to the following month.\",\"line\":26,\"span\":\"After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request and\\nare applied to the following month.\"},{\"text\":\"If the upload page is unavailable in the hour before the cut-off, team leads should email the payroll team.\",\"line\":31,\"span\":\"If the upload page is unavailable in the hour before the cut-off, email the\\npayroll team and keep the file.\"},{\"text\":\"If the upload page is unavailable in the hour before the cut-off, team leads should keep the file.\",\"line\":31,\"span\":\"If the upload page is unavailable in the hour before the cut-off, email the\\npayroll team and keep the file.\"},{\"text\":\"Totals should not be sent in the body of an email.\",\"line\":32,\"span\":\"Do not send totals in the body of an email.\"}]}","ttft_ms":7756,"type":"result","duration_ms":7793,"uuid":"92c97296-5399-4d6f-a858-d8097f02486d","ttft_stream_ms":1616,"time_to_request_ms":93,"first_content_frame_ms":1617,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
